          %h2#relation_to_properads_and_polycategories Relation to properads and polycategories
          %p
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Properads"} Properads
            have a similar multiple compositional structure to PROPs, but without the tensor product of morphisms, meaning operations cannot be concatenated.
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/polycategory"} Polycategories
            are also similar, but only allow composition along a single object at once. See
            %a{:href => "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/polycategory#relation_to_properads"} Polycategory: Relation to properads
            for a more detailed explanation.
